<title>BELGIUM: Belgian BMT sees 1997 profit, turnover up.</title>
<headline>Belgian BMT sees 1997 profit, turnover up.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian metals group BMT NV said in a statement on Friday it expected 1997 turnover and profit to be slightly higher than last year.</p>
<p>It said 1996 consolidated net profit jumped 25.6 percent to 254.7 million francs. Consolidated turnover rose 3.5 percent to 5.45 billion francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
